#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:2
msgid "Deploy Exported Policies with LEAPP"
msgstr "使用 LEAPP 部署导出的策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab provides :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` for running exported "
"policies back in simulation without the training infrastructure. This is the"
" Isaac Lab deployment path for LEAPP-exported policies and is useful for "
"validating that the packaged policy still behaves correctly when driven "
"through the deployment stack instead of the training stack."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 提供 :class:`~envs.LeappDeploymentEnv` ，用于在仿真中运行导出的策略，无需训练基础设施。这是 "
"Isaac Lab 中部署 LEAPP 导出策略的方式，可用于验证：由部署组件而非训练组件驱动时，打包后的策略是否仍能正常工作。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:11
msgid ""
"Run the deployment command with the task name and the exported LEAPP "
"``.yaml`` file. Use the same backend extra and backend selector that you "
"used for training and export, and pass a ``--viz`` option when you want a "
"viewport:"
msgstr ""
"运行部署命令时，指定任务名和导出的 LEAPP ``.yaml`` 文件。使用与训练、导出时相同的后端额外依赖及后端选择项；需要视口时，再传入 "
"``--viz`` 选项："

