#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:67
msgid "What the Deployment Environment Does"
msgstr "部署环境的工作方式"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:69
msgid ""
"The deployment environment loads the task scene and then bypasses the "
"training-time observation, action, reward, termination, and curriculum "
"managers. It reads the scene objects and commands identified by the "
"``isaaclab_connection`` metadata in the LEAPP YAML, uses them as inputs to "
"the exported policy pipeline, and runs that pipeline through LEAPP's "
"``InferenceManager``. The resulting outputs are written back to the mapped "
"scene entities."
msgstr ""
"部署环境加载任务场景后，会绕过训练时的观测、动作、奖励、终止和课程管理器。它读取 LEAPP YAML 中 "
"``isaaclab_connection`` 元数据指定的场景对象和命令，将其作为导出策略流水线的输入，并通过 LEAPP 的 "
"``InferenceManager`` 运行该流水线。得到的输出再写回映射的场景实体。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:77
msgid "Match the Training and Export Configuration"
msgstr "保持训练、导出配置一致"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:79
msgid ""
"The deployment command rebuilds the task configuration from ``--task``. It "
"cannot infer the training configuration from the checkpoint or LEAPP YAML, "
"so you must provide the same configuration selections used for training and "
"export. The task name, LEAPP YAML, and checkpoint must describe the same "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"部署命令根据 ``--task`` 重新构建任务配置，无法从检查点或 LEAPP YAML "
"推断训练配置，因此必须提供训练、导出时相同的配置选择。任务名、LEAPP YAML 和检查点必须对应同一策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:84
msgid ""
"Carry these settings through **training**, **export**, and **deployment**:"
msgstr "以下设置必须在 **训练** 、 **导出** 和 **部署** 三个阶段保持一致："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:86
msgid ""
"**Task and Hydra overrides:** use the same task name and every configuration"
" override that changes the scene, robot, sensors, command terms, "
"observation/action term configuration, reset behavior, or simulation timing "
"(``sim.dt`` and ``decimation``)."
msgstr ""
"**任务与 Hydra 覆盖设置：** 使用相同任务名，并保留所有会改变场景、机器人、传感器、命令项、观测/动作项配置、重置行为或仿真时序（ "
"``sim.dt`` 和 ``decimation`` ）的配置覆盖。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:89
msgid ""
"**Physics and renderer presets:** pass the same backend selectors when you "
"selected a non-default backend. For example, a policy trained and exported "
"with ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` must also be deployed with "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp``; the same applies to the untyped "
"``presets=<PRESET_NAME>`` form."
msgstr ""
"**物理与渲染器预设：** 如果选择了非默认后端，传入相同的后端选择项。例如，使用 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` "
"训练并导出的策略，部署时也必须使用 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` ；未限定类型的 "
"``presets=<PRESET_NAME>`` 形式同样如此。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Seed, when applicable:** use the same ``--seed`` when reproducible command"
" sampling, reset events, or other randomized task behavior matters to your "
"validation."
msgstr "**随机种子（适用时）：** 如果验证需要可复现的命令采样、重置事件或其他随机任务行为，请使用相同的 ``--seed`` 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:96
msgid "For example, append the preset after the deployment options:"
msgstr "例如，在部署选项后追加预设："

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:107
msgid "Visualization Options"
msgstr "可视化选项"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:109
msgid ""
"Visualization does not change the policy or its LEAPP inputs. Omit ``--viz``"
" for headless execution, use ``--viz kit`` for the Omniverse Kit viewport, "
"or select ``newton_gl``, ``newton_rtx`` (experimental), ``rerun``, or "
"``viser`` when those visualizers are installed. Use ``--viz none`` to "
"explicitly disable all visualizers, and ``--max_visible_envs <COUNT>`` to "
"limit displayed environments. Choose a visualizer compatible with the "
"selected physics and renderer backend."
msgstr ""
"可视化不会改变策略或其 LEAPP 输入。省略 ``--viz`` 可无界面运行，使用 ``--viz kit`` 可打开 Omniverse Kit "
"视口；安装相应可视化器后，也可选择 ``newton_gl`` 、 ``newton_rtx`` （实验性）、 ``rerun`` 或 "
"``viser`` 。使用 ``--viz none`` 可显式关闭全部可视化器， ``--max_visible_envs <COUNT>`` "
"可限制显示的环境数。请选择与当前物理及渲染后端兼容的可视化器。"

#: source/policy_deployment/05_leapp/deploying_exported_policies_with_leapp.rst:118
msgid ""
"For Direct workflow policies, see the :doc:`Direct workflow export guide "
"<exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp>`. Direct workflow policies "
"are not supported by ``LeappDeploymentEnv``."
msgstr ""
"Direct 工作流策略见 :doc:`Direct 工作流导出指南 "
"<exporting_direct_workflow_policies_with_leapp>` 。 ``LeappDeploymentEnv`` "
"不支持 Direct 工作流策略。"
